WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.300
A dispute that crosses borders needs counsel.

2
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:10.417
Ferrow &amp; Lisle is an imaginary disputes firm in London and New York.

3
00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.950
Six practices each list their recent highlights.

4
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Then four professionals, from the senior partner to counsel.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:24.100
Each has a biography and three representative matters.

6
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.233
A map marks both offices and four cities of client work.

7
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.833
Each pin leads to the contact form.

8
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:40.617
Each pin is two numbers an editor types in, tied to the map’s projection.

9
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:46.833
A written contract set what could change, and one script writes all the content.

10
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:52.800
Choose a practice and meet the professionals, at legal.junaid.guru.
